# P6 on Windows (WinUI): the steps of actions/mac/P6-transport-toggles.actions -- Sound, Frame drop, then the Speed and FPS pop-ups by keyboard. Positions measured 2026-10-20 with test_support/measure/measure_win.zsh (DIPs at 125%): transport row y 750, Sound 798, Frame drop 879, Speed 384, FPS 502.
# Pass: the status line reports Frame drop on, Sound the opposite of how it started (autoplay starts it on, so the click turns it off), and neither 1x nor 30 FPS any more.
